{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a relaxing game after a tough day at school, work, or just existing? Then look further, because this may not be for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Throwing Knight</i>, you\u2019ll launch yourself like a slingshot projectile, fail 567 times, and then finally land a perfect jump\u2014just to fall into the next pit. A brutally challenging platformer where every move is controlled entirely with your mouse\u2014drag, aim, and pray for the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/78522f2ba7cd4010f6ee71bd8f5b12fa.poster.avif?t=1757627646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/78522f2ba7cd4010f6ee71bd8f5b12fa.webm?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/78522f2ba7cd4010f6ee71bd8f5b12fa.mp4?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your temper across four levels, each with unique obstacles and atmosphere. Use your mouse to control direction and strength of the jump. Swing on physics-based chains to overcome greater distances. Avoid every trap designed with only one goal: to kill you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/06145f1020004b610c8902b68cff160d.poster.avif?t=1757627646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/06145f1020004b610c8902b68cff160d.webm?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/06145f1020004b610c8902b68cff160d.mp4?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the potions to get needful lives when you reach the checkpoint. Find out the time and number of deaths it took to finally complete the level, and try to bring those numbers down on your next attempt. Have fun and don\u2019t get too mad. GIT GUD !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/9b70ac0af9ea37bb4b4dbe8fadae581d.poster.avif?t=1757627646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/9b70ac0af9ea37bb4b4dbe8fadae581d.webm?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/9b70ac0af9ea37bb4b4dbe8fadae581d.mp4?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you believe you\u2019ve got what it takes? Then prove it \u2013 ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3206750?t=1757627646","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3206750?t=1757627646","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/6c356cddfd3bb39e016bffb96b46b742b04a9c8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757627646","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/6c356cddfd3bb39e016bffb96b46b742b04a9c8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757627646","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3894970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a relaxing game after a tough day at school, work, or just existing? Then look further, because this may not be for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Throwing Knight</i>, you\u2019ll launch yourself like a slingshot projectile, fail 567 times, and then finally land a perfect jump\u2014just to fall into the next pit. A brutally challenging platformer where every move is controlled entirely with your mouse\u2014drag, aim, and pray for the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/78522f2ba7cd4010f6ee71bd8f5b12fa.poster.avif?t=1757627646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/78522f2ba7cd4010f6ee71bd8f5b12fa.webm?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/78522f2ba7cd4010f6ee71bd8f5b12fa.mp4?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your temper across four levels, each with unique obstacles and atmosphere. Use your mouse to control direction and strength of the jump. Swing on physics-based chains to overcome greater distances. Avoid every trap designed with only one goal: to kill you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/06145f1020004b610c8902b68cff160d.poster.avif?t=1757627646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/06145f1020004b610c8902b68cff160d.webm?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/06145f1020004b610c8902b68cff160d.mp4?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the potions to get needful lives when you reach the checkpoint. Find out the time and number of deaths it took to finally complete the level, and try to bring those numbers down on your next attempt. Have fun and don\u2019t get too mad. GIT GUD !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/9b70ac0af9ea37bb4b4dbe8fadae581d.poster.avif?t=1757627646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/9b70ac0af9ea37bb4b4dbe8fadae581d.webm?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/extras/9b70ac0af9ea37bb4b4dbe8fadae581d.mp4?t=1757627646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you believe you\u2019ve got what it takes? Then prove it \u2013 ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</p>","developers":["Michal V\u00e1ro\u0161"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206750/9d977117b92abe762986f965776f84dffd83f675/header.jpg?t=1757627646","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Michal V\u00e1ro\u0161. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n\u201eThe assets in this game, including but not limited to sounds, models, and textures, are copyrighted and may not be extracted, modified, or used outside of the game without explicit permission. However, gameplay footage and streaming of this game is explicitly allowed and encouraged.\u201c","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3206750/450513933/7c231d88f350ab011bbb654bfddf69f55204eff9/1757625258/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757627640",